'''Apocalypse''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the 2nd tier in the Survivors Rewards during the [[Halloween Event 2022|2022 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
Its blade is a rusted silver with bold engraved lines and four circular screws. The guard and handle are silver, but the handle is also tightly wrapped in brown fabric.

==Trivia==
*It has a [[Apocalypse (Gun)|partner gun]] under the same name.
*Only players that joined the Survivors team were able to obtain this through a tier. However, if players joined the Zombies team instead, they could only purchase the [[Infected Knife (2022)|Infected]] knife through the same tier.

